 "pdf_title": "CHAPTER 7 PREMISES OF DACOITY AND ROBBERY The cases registered under 'Dacoity' and 'Robbery' in the country were further analysed according to the place of occurrence of these two crimes. The highest number of 'Dacoity' cases (9,396) were committed in residential premises and only two cases in 'Rivers and Sea' were reported out of 14,028 total cases. The highest number of Robbery cases (6,620) were committed in residential premises, followed by 'Robbery on high-ways' (3,383) and only 11 cases of 'Robbery in Banks' were reported during 1979. In Delhi the majority of robberies were on highways. The relevant statistics are set forth in Table-50 and 51.",
